{
  "title": "Duplicate Zeros",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "type": "array",
  "tags": [
    "Array",
    "Two Pointers"
  ],
  "description": "Given a fixed-length integer array arr, duplicate each occurrence of zero, shifting the remaining elements to the right.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1: let n = arr.length\n2: let zeros = countZeros()\n3: for i = n - 1, j = n + zeros - 1; i >= 0; i--, j--:\n4:   if arr[i] != 0:\n5:     if j < n: arr[j] = arr[i]\n6:   else:\n7:     if j < n: arr[j] = 0\n8:     j--\n9:     if j < n: arr[j] = 0",
